stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Untracked: create a file
    Untracked --> Ignored: matches a pattern<br>in .gitignore
    Untracked --> Staged: git add
    Staged --> Tracked: git commit
    Tracked --> Staged: edit, then git add
    Ignored --> Staged: git add -f<br>(forces it in)
    Tracked --> Untracked: git rm --cached<br>(stop tracking)
